# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tauri updater signing keys — NEVER commit private keys
# Canonical local path: ~/.tauri/remedy.key  (and .pub)
# Public key is embedded in desktop/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json (safe to commit)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.tauri/
**/.tauri/
*.key
*.key.pub
remedy.key
remedy.key.pub
**/remedy.key
**/remedy.key.pub
# Local update signatures (regenerated by CI / tauri signer)
*.sig
*.exe.sig

# Local build ledger / scratch
.remedy-build/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only trees — stay on disk, not in the public compile/release repo
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
examples/
community/
experiments/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public docs allowlist — AGENTS.md "Public GitHub docs".
# Ignore every other top-level docs/*.md (session notes, plans, essays,
# audits). docs/manual/ is not matched by docs/*.md and stays tracked.
# To publish a new top-level doc: add !docs/ThatFile.md here AND add it to
# the AGENTS.md allowlist in the same commit. Never git add -f.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
docs/*.md
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
!docs/DESKTOP.md
!docs/REMEDY_PERSONA.md
!docs/SKILL_LIFECYCLE.md
!docs/TELEPHONY.md
!docs/TELEPHONY_TERMS.md
!docs/TERMS.md
!docs/THIRD_PARTY.md
!docs/USAGE.md
!docs/WEB_ETIQUETTE.md
!docs/WINDOWS_SIGNING.md
docs/_*/
docs/_*.json
docs/*soak*
docs/*signoff*

